# Prevents the M-1-era BOM/CRLF class of problem reaching a migration.
#
# migrations/*.sql is SQL executed by Postgres. core.autocrlf on Windows rewrites
# line endings on checkout and some editors prepend a UTF-8 BOM; Postgres rejects a
# BOM with error 42601, which surfaced as migrate deploy failing on a fresh
# database while the development database ? created with db push ? never noticed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sql text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.dump binary
